  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>A dog washing station in Cavalaire-sur-Mer is located at the entrance of town, right next to the Avia Xpress petrol station (near Avenue de Saint-Raphaël, D559). It's a blue cabin from the Wash.ME Group brand, with a washing tub, hose and built-in dog dryer, immediately visible next to the petrol station.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>We visited on site on 26 September 2026, and the price grid we saw is the same as the one published by the equipment brand, Wash Toutou (Wash.ME group, washtoutou.wash-megroup.com). The brand announces 24/7 access, no appointment, with payment by bank card, Google Pay or Apple Pay. The instructions displayed on the cabin follow 4 steps: put your dog in the tub by lowering the access ramp and attaching the supplied safety chain, touch the screen to choose the wash time and pay, use the hose and select programmes as needed (hypoallergenic shampoo, conditioner, anti-parasite treatment, rinse), then select "Drying" (pressing a second time stops the programme — towel-drying beforehand is recommended). Two options are offered on the home screen: "Small dog" at €10 for 10 minutes, or "Large dog" at €15 for 15 minutes; a "Custom time" option is also available, at €1 per minute (from 2 to 20 minutes).</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: look for the Avia petrol station at the entrance of Cavalaire — the washing station is right next to it, on the same side of the road, recognisable by its blue "Dog Wash Station" cabin.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>The town centre and harbour of Cavalaire-sur-Mer are a few minutes' drive away.</p>
